 ],
 "notes": "From one aerial view (photo 00 / sheet1) of the garden side: low flat-roofed house of white plaster with dark-timber fascias and a clerestory band, ground floor glazed onto a timber deck, pergola on slim wood posts over an outdoor kitchen and bar, small raised blue plunge pool in a white surround, pizza oven and white seat wall, a stepping-stone garden, clipped hedges, a lawn, tall pines on the ridge, and a glass-railed roof terrace with white sofas. Interior photos (oak floors, open-riser stair, beams) are not modelled. Three renders against it: round 1 the glazing read as white wall and the pool as a white block; round 2 glass recessed behind dark interiors and a clerestory strip added; round 3 the pool basin cut out of its surround so the water shows blue, the pergola roof thinned. Still off: pergola roof reads heavy, roof deck reads brown not white/glass, hedges too regular. Guessed: all dimensions and plan, orientation (house to the west), the number of floors and wings, everything beyond the garden. Placed only at the town of Del Mar. Round 4: roof deck slab now white, pergola roof thinned."
